flowchart TD
    subgraph Client[Desktop application]
        Open[Open Markdown file] --> Parse{Contains diagram?}
        Parse -->|No| Text[Render document]
        Parse -->|Yes| Queue[Queue background work]
    end
    Queue --> Cache{Cached result?}
    Cache -->|Yes| Display[Display diagram]
    Cache -->|No| Render[Parse and lay out diagram]
    Render --> Validate{Within limits?}
    Validate -->|Yes| Save[Cache rendered image]
    Save --> Display
    Validate -->|No| Fallback[Show source and error]
    Display --> Text
    Fallback --> Text
